摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"dsh plugin: drive an existing dsh session from Feishu/Lark — outbound-only bot, /resume picker, run status card","id":"gh:1343972220","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-feishu","slug":"fan56/dsh-feishu","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"dsh plugin: drive an existing dsh session from Feishu/Lark — outbound-only bot, /resume picker, run "},{"id":"p1s2","text":" drive an existing dsh session from Feishu/Lark — outbound-only bot, /resume picker, run status card"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-feishu"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Drive an existing dsh (DeepSeek Harness) session from Feishu/Lark on your phone — dispatch work, wat"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ch progress live, answer questions, get the results. Outbound-only WebSocket: no open ports, no tunn"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"rogress live, answer questions, get the results. Outbound-only WebSocket: no open ports, no tunnels."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Requires dsh >= 0.2.0-rc.2** — this plugin targets the dsh RC/stable line only (CI and releases re"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"solve the newest of the `latest`/`next` dist-tags at runtime). **The alpha line is no longer support"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" the newest of the `latest`/`next` dist-tags at runtime). **The alpha line is no longer supported.**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## ✨ Highlights"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **One-command onboarding**: `/feishu-onboard` on the desktop — scan-to-create the Feishu app, auto"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"-writes credentials + operators, hot-activates without a restart\n- **Self-serve pairing**: empty all"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"owlist → the first DM claims admin via a one-tap card\n- **Live round cards**: one card per LLM round"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"-trip — current state (🤔 thinking / 🔧 tool / ⏳ subagent), tool calls, and a growing tail of the in-f"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"light message, refreshed every **5 seconds** (pseudo-streaming)\n- **Replies land in the round card**"},{"id":"p7s6","text":": when a round settles, its answer embeds into the very card you were watching — a `💬 Round 回复` sect"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"ion right above the stats footer — instead of arriving as a bare message wedged between status cards"},{"id":"p7s8","text":" (answers longer than one body segment still ship as their own cards)\n- **Quick actions on the round"},{"id":"p7s9","text":" card**: ⛔ 停止 while a turn runs, ▶️ 继续 once it ends — one tap instead of typing\n- **Approval cards**"},{"id":"p7s10","text":": when the host's approval waterfall asks for a sandbox escalation, the phone gets a **✅ 允许一次 / ❌ 拒绝"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"** card — an unattended run no longer stalls at the desk (the session's approval policy must be `ask"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"`; expiry fails closed)\n- **Interactive ask-user cards**: when the agent calls `ask_user_question`, "},{"id":"p7s13","text":"your phone gets an **interactive card** (dropdown / multi-select / text input + submit); the answer "},{"id":"p7s14","text":"flows straight back. Pair it with ask-router for **both desktop and phone prompting — first answer w"},{"id":"p7s15","text":"ins**\n- **Group chats**: pull the bot into a Feishu group — @-mention it to dispatch work or run com"},{"id":"p7s16","text":"mands (allowlisted members only, silent to everyone else); in the group the bot is actively driving,"},{"id":"p7s17","text":" images flow **without** a mention\n- **Image dispatch**: send a picture in DM — it is downloaded, me"},{"id":"p7s18","text":"dia-type sniffed, committed as a durable attachment and injected into the session as an image block "},{"id":"p7s19","text":"(the session's model route must accept image input)\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 🎬 Demo"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**`/new` starts a fresh session; dispatch work right from the phone:**"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/177e8839-523b-487e-b3d1-6d725cd8aba5"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**`/resume` interactive session picker + answering an ask-user card:**"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c0d7092f-deda-4443-b75a-2bc93bd30d86"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## 🚀 Install & Configure"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Step 1: Install the plugin into your profile (≈2 min)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**From npm (recommended):**"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**Or from a git checkout** (when hacking on the plugin itself):"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Edit `~/.dsh/profiles/<your-profile>/package.json`:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Step 2: Configure the bot — pick one"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"`/feishu-onboard` is a **desktop** command — run it in the dsh TUI on your\ncomputer (from the phone "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"it replies with a pointer back to the desktop). The\nthree options below mirror the three paths the c"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"h a pointer back to the desktop). The\nthree options below mirror the three paths the command offers."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"#### Option A — `/feishu-onboard` (recommended, ≈2 min, no Feishu console needed)"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Run `/feishu-onboard` — in the TUI or the web UI. It asks a handful of\nquestions one by one through "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"dsh's native ask prompt (web: the question card\npops right in the browser, scoped to your open sessi"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"on; no ask provider or no\nlive session? it degrades to a plain printed guide) and picks the path wit"},{"id":"p25s4","text":" ask provider or no\nlive session? it degrades to a plain printed guide) and picks the path with\nyou:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **Scan to create the app** — zero Feishu console work\n- **Bind an app you already have** — see Opt"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ion B\n- **Manual guide** — see Option C"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"On the scan path the launcher link arrives as a question card — web: right\nin the browser (TTY also "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"renders a QR code) → open it on your phone or\ndesktop, confirm in Feishu, then tap 「我已完成确认」 → the pl"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ugin creates an\nenterprise custom app for you via Feishu's\nofficial scan-to-create flow (OAuth devic"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"e flow, official SDK `registerApp`),\npre-provisioned with everything this plugin needs:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- Bot capability\n- Long-connection events: `im.message.receive_v1`, `card.action.trigger`\n- Permissi"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ons: `im:message:send_as_bot`, `im:message.p2p_msg:readonly`,\n`im:message.group_at_msg:readonly`, `i"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"m:message.resources:readonly`,\n`im:message.reactions:write`, `im:chat:readonly`"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Then it finishes the job: `app_id`/`app_secret` are written into the dsh\ncredentials service (refs `"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"DSH_FEISHU_APP_ID` / `DSH_FEISHU_APP_SECRET`), the\nscanning user is added as an operator, and the pl"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"ugin **hot-activates in the\nsame process** — no dsh restart. Scan, then DM the bot; that's the whole"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"hot-activates in the\nsame process** — no dsh restart. Scan, then DM the bot; that's the whole\nsetup."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"> Fine print: the preset permissions ride a platform gray release. Where the\n> gray hasn't landed, t"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"he command verifies them automatically and guides the\n> top-up with a permission-preselection deep l"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"ink. And for **colleagues** to\n> use the bot you still publish it once under Version Management & Re"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"lease\n> (not needed for your own use)."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"#### Option B — You already have a Feishu app"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Two ways to hand the credentials to the plugin:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- **Run `/feishu-onboard` and pick \"existing app\"**: enter App ID / App Secret\n(written only to the "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"local credentials file — never into session logs) →\nthe command verifies them against the API on the"},{"id":"p33s3","text":" spot; wrong credentials\nare re-asked; if the app lacks the bot capability (error code `11205`) the\n"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"credentials are still saved and a console fix checklist is printed. You can\nalso add your own open_i"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"d as an operator there.\n- **Or write the two files yourself**:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Only allowlisted Feishu users can use the bot — everyone else is invisible:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
